    "chunk_text": "\u00e6t he \u00e6t Ac he hit \u00feurhteah, & mid weor\u00fescipe geendade. \u00de\u00e6r w\u00e6s Gallia VII M ofslagen, & XVII M gefangen. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Claudius se consul gefeaht wi\u00f0 G\u00e6lle, & hiora ofslog XXX M, & he self gefeaht wi\u00f0 \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m wunnon Is\u00ferie on Romane. \u00dea sendon hi heora consulas angean, Cornelius & Minutius. \u00de\u00e6r w\u00e6s micel w\u00e6l geslagen on \u00e6g\u00feere healfe, & Is\u00ferie wurdon \u00feeh Romanum under\u00feiedde. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Romeburg getimbred w\u00e6s V hunde wintrum & XXXIII, Hannibal, Pena cyning, On \u00feam gewinne, & eac on monegum o\u00f0rum \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6m, Hannibal gecy\u00fede \u00feone ni\u00fe & \u00feone hete \u00dea \u00fea Publius Cornelius, & Scipa Publius, & Sempronius Longus, \u00fea hie w\u00e6ron consulas, Swa \u00feonne he to \u00f0\u00e6m syndrigum stane com, \u00feonne het he hiene mid fyre onh\u00e6tan, & si\u00fe\u00fean mid His heres w\u00e6s an M fe\u00f0ena & XX M gehorsedra. \u00dea he h\u00e6fde on \u00fe\u00e6m emnete gefaren o\u00fe he com to Ticenan \u00fe\u00e6re ie, \u00fea com him \u00f0\u00e6r ongean \u00de\u00e6r wear\u00f0 Romana micel w\u00e6l geslagen. Hiora \u00f0\u00e6t \u00e6fterre gefeoht w\u00e6s \u00e6t Trefia \u00f0\u00e6re ie, & eft w\u00e6ron Romane forsl\u00e6gen & gefliemed. \u00dea \u00fe\u00e6t Sempronius hierde, heora o\u00feer consul, se w\u00e6s on Sicilium mid firde gefaren, he \u00feonan \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m for Hannibal ofer Bardan \u00fe",
